     return (
       <div className="App">
         <ImageClassifier />
       </div>
     );
   }

   export default App;
   ```

6. **Run Your Application**: Start your React application using `npm start`. You can now upload images through the input field, and the neural network, powered by TensorFlow.js, will classify the images and display the results.

